WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
The tested GPU goes on a circuit board.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
The board receives power and talks to the main processor.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
The chassis holds the parts and the cooling system.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
The server is secured inside its packaging.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
The shipment travels with the checks its route requires.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
The receiver checks its condition before installing the equipment.
